<title>PORTUGAL: Yield falls on Portugal 3-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>Yield falls on Portugal 3-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is the result of the Portuguese Treasury's auction of 25 billion escudos of three-year fixed-rate bonds (OT).</p>
<p>    ISSUER: Republic of Portugal   MATURITY: 23 Mar 2000</p>
<p>    COUPON: 5.375	 AVERAGE ACCEPTED YIELD: 5.3860</p>
<p>AMOUNT PLACED 30 bln esc:  HIGHEST ACCEPTED YIELD: 5.42</p>
<p>PAYMENT FREQUENCY: Annual</p>
<p>NOTES: The issue is fungible. The auction takes to 78 billion escudos the total amount of the bonds issued.</p>
</text>
